  "contents": [
    {
      "id": "4b3406a7-3450-48c2-9a77-dcd07bd311bf",
      "title": "Observe a imagem, escute a frase e ligue o espanhol ao apoio em portugues.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "b1b98d90-32ad-4ca1-86b9-c733d2b4365d",
          "textContent": "<p>Observe a cena, escute e acompanhe a frase.</p><p><strong>Desde que me mudé a Recife, estudio español con más constancia.</strong></p><p>Em portugues: <strong>Desde que me mudei para Recife, estudo espanhol com mais constância.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/219cec1e72f346dd92d55572044b2106_b01-recife-study-scene.png?Expires=1794099683&Signature=EhFsFAZm6MdmQwFxKWU2JBykBcZHuT4UGdR5DpV-h0CDFR8yIKxNxYeAeI1zEtfSb5lMQD06tOXgd9KdCP79uclC0dAizVKmgnOgvXrKEoP4kno6ADN-exaNOBFtPeReGKOWU1MObGbxLiFeCyadAoZplQxE6YpA4ZInrfeLkOQ2LdBhJqS9OedMTyoDfI2ZUzUaYzuRj67W1MZWXhj4Sd8SO-R~UWI59Y2eq4qea1fIXhx4tp2YQNzR~R~k2CJ01QOX19BghPfBlpD8MeDoxAwPZ249g4F7gXQBz8QBo05XqMsXvNNE2t3I8favqErG9o57AGgxVGLvekDMiiU2IQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
